I left out the two operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so the world has no import for a file log or the metadata HTTP service, and adding either would exceed the node's authority. If those are needed, they belong on a node whose `with` clause grants them, or the graph needs amending.

